usage: uv run plato.py [-h] [-i ID] [-p PORT] [-c CONFIG] [-b BASE]
                       [-s SERVER] [-u] [-m] [-r] [-l LOG]

options:
  -h, --help           show this help message and exit
  -i, --id ID          Unique client ID.
  -p, --port PORT      The port number for running a server.
  -c, --config CONFIG  Federated learning configuration file.
  -b, --base BASE      The base path for datasets, models, checkpoints, and
                       results.
  -s, --server SERVER  The server hostname and port number.
  -u, --cpu            Use CPU as the device.
  -m, --mps            Use MPS as the device.
  -r, --resume         Resume a previously interrupted training session.
  -l, --log LOG        Log messages level.
